%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: eb7fd957924e60a4e8e19d8f1adb7bf5, type: 3}
  m_Name: TutorialCatalog
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Cooking::Cooking.Data.TutorialCatalog
  segments:
  - id: night0_intro
    lines:
    - textZh: "\u8FD9\u91CC\u662F\u54EA\u2026\u2026\u6211\u662F\u8C01\uFF1F"
      textEn: Where is this... Who am I?
      expressionId: Main_Normal
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cfdf2882c7d3d1040bdea747af36b7ae, type: 3}
    - textZh: "\u809A\u5B50\u597D\u997F\uFF0C\u6709\u4EC0\u4E48\u80FD\u5403\u7684\u5417\u3002"
      textEn: I'm so hungry. Is there anything to eat?
      expressionId: Main_Worry
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5f47d63f54f417945b151124eea7898d, type: 3}
    - textZh: "\u95FB\u5230\u4E00\u80A1\u719F\u6089\u7684\u9999\u5473\uFF0C\u597D\u50CF\u662F\u2026\u2026\u8611\u83C7\uFF1F\u8FC7\u53BB\u770B\u770B\u5427\uFF0C\u8BF4\u4E0D\u5B9A\u771F\u80FD\u627E\u5230\u70B9\u4E1C\u897F\u3002"
      textEn: I smell a familiar aroma. It seems to be... mushrooms? Let me go take
        a look. Maybe I can really find something.
      expressionId: Main_Smile
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e94ae6311ee3a3b41af55d8f4e9e88fc, type: 3}
  - id: night0_after_hint
    lines:
    - textZh: "\u771F\u5012\u9709\uFF0C\u53C8\u51B7\u53C8\u997F\uFF0C\u8FD8\u5F88\u56F0\u3002\u5148\u56DE\u53BB\u7761\u4F1A\uFF0C\u8D77\u5E8A\u518D\u60F3\u60F3\u5403\u4EC0\u4E48\u3002"
      textEn: How unlucky. I'm cold, hungry, and sleepy too. I'll go back and sleep
        for a while first, then think about what to eat after I wake up.
      expressionId: Main_Defeat
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a5532e74ddec65b4797fcd742d3cd65e, type: 3}
  - id: night0_post_forage
    lines:
    - textZh: "\u8FD9\u91CC\u7684\u591C\u665A\u5B9E\u5728\u662F\u592A\u51B7\u4E86\uFF0C\u5E78\u8FD0\u7684\u662F\uFF0C\u6211\u6361\u5230\u4E86\u4E0D\u5C11\u8611\u83C7\u3002\u7B49\u660E\u5929\u9192\u4E86\uFF0C\u6216\u8BB8\u80FD\u7172\u9505\u6C64\u6696\u6696\u8EAB\u5B50\u3002"
      textEn: The nights here are really too cold. Fortunately, I picked up quite
        a few mushrooms. After I wake up tomorrow, maybe I can make a pot of soup
        to warm myself up.
      expressionId: Main_Smile
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e94ae6311ee3a3b41af55d8f4e9e88fc, type: 3}
    - textZh: "\u592A\u665A\u4E86\u5148\u56DE\u5230\u5E10\u7BF7\u7761\u89C9\u5427\u3002"
      textEn: It's too late, let's head back to the tent and sleep.
      expressionId: Main_Normal
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cfdf2882c7d3d1040bdea747af36b7ae, type: 3}
  - id: day1_wakeup
    lines:
    - textZh: "\u5148\u770B\u770B\u98DF\u8C31\u5427\uFF0C\u6211\u53EF\u4E0D\u60F3\u56E0\u4E3A\u5403\u5230\u6CA1\u716E\u719F\u7684\u8611\u83C7\u53BB\u4E16\u3002"
      textEn: Let me look at the recipe first. I don't want to die from eating undercooked
        mushrooms.
      expressionId: Main_Worry
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5f47d63f54f417945b151124eea7898d, type: 3}
  - id: day1_after_recipe
    lines:
    - textZh: "\u8611\u83C7\u5F97\u5148\u5207\u788E\u3002\u624B\u91CC\u7684\u5200\u610F\u5916\u987A\u624B\uFF0C\u597D\u50CF\u6211\u66FE\u8FD9\u6837\u505A\u8FC7\u65E0\u6570\u6B21\u3002"
      textEn: The mushrooms need to be chopped first. The knife in my hand is unexpectedly
        handy, as if I have done this countless times before.
      expressionId: Main_Normal
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cfdf2882c7d3d1040bdea747af36b7ae, type: 3}
  - id: day1_fry
    lines:
    - textZh: "\u63A5\u4E0B\u6765\u5F97\u60F3\u529E\u6CD5\u628A\u5B83\u5F04\u719F\uFF0C\u76F4\u89C9\u544A\u8BC9\u6211\uFF0C\u628A\u5B83\u62D6\u5230\u7076\u53F0\u7089\u5B50\u4E0A\u7684\u4EFB\u610F\u4E00\u683C\u4E2D\uFF0C\u7528\u714E\u66F4\u5FEB\u3002"
      textEn: Next, I have to find a way to cook them. Drag it to any slot on the
        stove. Intuition tells me frying is faster.
      expressionId: Main_Confidence
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8b356976984a41c4cb994867d0a90a79, type: 3}
  - id: day1_oil
    lines:
    - textZh: "\u8FD8\u5DEE\u4E00\u70B9\u6CB9\uFF0C\u8981\u628A\u8611\u83C7\u672C\u8EAB\u7684\u9999\u5473\u903C\u51FA\u6765\uFF0C\u6C64\u624D\u4F1A\u597D\u559D\u3002"
      textEn: I still need a little oil to bring out the mushrooms' own aroma, so
        the soup will taste better.
      expressionId: Main_Normal
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cfdf2882c7d3d1040bdea747af36b7ae, type: 3}
  - id: day1_boil
    lines:
    - textZh: "\u6CE8\u610F\u706B\u5019\uFF0C\u5DEE\u4E0D\u591A\u719F\u4E86\u5C31\u53EF\u4EE5\u635E\u8FDB\u7096\u9505\u91CC\u3002"
      textEn: Pay attention to the heat. Once they are almost cooked, I can scoop
        them into the stew pot.
      expressionId: Main_Pray
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4923b551761e48244b270d507dcb11c2, type: 3}
  - id: day1_salt
    lines:
    - textZh: "\u8BB0\u5F97\u8C03\u5473\uFF0C\u4E0D\u7136\u6C64\u4F1A\u53D8\u5F97\u5BE1\u6DE1\u7684\u3002"
      textEn: Remember to season it, otherwise the soup will become bland.
      expressionId: Main_Normal
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cfdf2882c7d3d1040bdea747af36b7ae, type: 3}
  - id: day1_scoop
    lines:
    - textZh: "\u5B8C\u6210\u4E86\uFF0C\u628A\u5B83\u4EEC\u635E\u51FA\u6765\u5907\u7528\u3002"
      textEn: Done. Scoop them out and set them aside.
      expressionId: Main_Happy
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0d9d4a104912594408a7937c4dd198fb, type: 3}
  - id: day1_find_plate
    lines:
    - textZh: "\u76D8\u5B50\u5728\u54EA\uFF1F\u603B\u4E0D\u80FD\u8BA9\u6211\u7A7A\u624B\u5403\u5427\u3002"
      textEn: Where is the plate? Can't expect me to eat with my bare hands, right?
      expressionId: Main_Forced
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ce9ac9c394da55944ac6c66c52904c1c, type: 3}
  - id: day1_plate
    lines:
    - textZh: "\u8BE5\u6446\u76D8\u4E86\u3002"
      textEn: Time to plate it.
      expressionId: Main_Smile
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e94ae6311ee3a3b41af55d8f4e9e88fc, type: 3}
  - id: day1_taste
    lines:
    - textZh: "\u5473\u9053\u4E0D\u9519\uFF0C\u770B\u6765\u6211\u4EE5\u524D\u624B\u827A\u633A\u597D\u7684\u561B\u3002\u53EA\u6709\u8611\u83C7\u8FD8\u662F\u592A\u5355\u8C03\u4E86\uFF0C\u5E0C\u671B\u540E\u9762\u80FD\u627E\u5230\u66F4\u591A\u3002"
      textEn: It tastes good. It seems my cooking skills used to be pretty good.
        Just mushrooms alone is still too monotonous. I hope I can find more later.
      expressionId: Main_Happy
      expression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0d9d4a104912594408a7937c4dd198fb, type: 3}
